  "details": "Description\n\nWhen i rotate my phone and activated the face tracking and it goes to the wrong side in camera face tracking so please fix this bug on my phone device\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIn Monday i went go to Vrchat and i try to go in every world server but it happened when the VRCHAT got update in new version.. i try to rotate phone mode and i try to open the camera face tracking but it actually happened when i on the face tracking camera  and it looks like the head tracking of avatar goes to wrong way and i try again and again but it nothing getting fix after that.. so please i need you fix this bug.. \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: AndroidMobile (platform: Android - Mobile, store: PlayStore, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p1-1920-5a72154dad-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-07_15-11-00.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_fe0dc749-31d9-47a4-9695-d32f7f3e2cac/1/file)",
